{"speciesId":387,"names":{"fr":"Tortipouss","es":"Turtwig","en":"Turtwig","ja":"ナエトル"},"descriptions":[{"language":"en","version":"diamond","text":"Made from soil, the shell on its back hardens when it drinks water. It lives along lakes."},{"language":"en","version":"pearl","text":"It undertakes photosynthesis with its body, making oxygen. The leaf on its head wilts if it is thirsty."},{"language":"en","version":"platinum","text":"The shell on its back is made of soil. On a very healthy TURTWIG, the shell should feel moist."},{"language":"en","version":"heartgold","text":"Photosynthesis occurs across its body under the sun. The shell on its back is actually hardened soil."},{"language":"en","version":"soulsilver","text":"Photosynthesis occurs across its body under the sun. The shell on its back is actually hardened soil."},{"language":"fr","version":"black","text":"La coquille sur son dos est faite de terre. Plus il est en bonne santé, plus elle est humide."},{"language":"en","version":"black","text":"The shell on its back is made of soil. On a very healthy Turtwig, the shell should feel moist."},{"language":"fr","version":"white","text":"La coquille sur son dos est faite de terre. Plus il est en bonne santé, plus elle est humide."},{"language":"en","version":"white","text":"The shell on its back is made of soil. On a very healthy Turtwig, the shell should feel moist."},{"language":"en","version":"black-2","text":"The shell on its back is made of soil. On a very healthy Turtwig, the shell should feel moist."},{"language":"en","version":"white-2","text":"The shell on its back is made of soil. On a very healthy Turtwig, the shell should feel moist."},{"language":"fr","version":"x","text":"Son corps assimile la lumière du soleil par photosynthèse. Sa carapace est faite de terre durcie."},{"language":"es","version":"x","text":"Realiza la fotosíntesis al bañarle los rayos de sol. Su concha está formada por tierra endurecida."},{"language":"en","version":"x","text":"Photo